WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Finding your way around. The main sidebar, the workspace sidebar, and the header controls.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: morning check-in; switching teams.

3
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.190
The main sidebar lists your workspaces.

4
00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.030
The workspace sidebar has planning pages: Today…

5
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.630
…Upcoming…

6
00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.210
…Timeline, Capacity, Habits, Stats, Review and Goals.

7
00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.980
In the header: notifications…

8
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.970
…and theme controls.

9
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:25.930
And these Docs are always one click away.

10
00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:31.930
I can't see the sidebars on my phone: Open the menu button in the header for the main sidebar; the workspace sidebar sits at the top of the page on small screens. A workspace is missing: You only see workspaces you belong to. Ask an admin for an invite.

11
00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:36.430
Every workspace page one click away
